## 🔧 ELIMINACIÓN DE DEPENDENCIAS

### Referencias eliminadas:
- ❌ `from sqlalchemy import ...`
- ❌ `from sqlmodel import ...`
- ❌ `Session` management
- ❌ `select()` statements de SQLModel
- ❌ `session.exec()` 
- ❌ `session.add()`
- ❌ `session.commit()`
- ❌ `session.refresh()`

### Nuevas referencias (Peewee):
- ✅ `from core.peewee_db import ...`
- ✅ `from peewee import Model, AutoField, ...`
- ✅ `Model.select()`
- ✅ `Model.get_by_id()`
- ✅ `model.save()`
- ✅ `model.delete_instance()`

